--
--   Description
----------------
--   This test ensures that the GEM Idle match functionality works properly.
--
-- Detailed Test Description
--
--  Note: This is an overall description of the test below.  
-- Procedure:
--
--     1.Initialize by resetting the device by any means.
--     2.Provide a stream of /I/ codes to the GEM. Continue until the GEM sources a non-zero Config_Reg.
--     3.Provide a stream of at least 20 /C/ codes where Config_Reg takes on any value, so long as ACK=0 
--       followed by at least 10 Config_Reg values with the ACK bit set.
--     4.Provide a continuous stream of /I/ codes to the GEM as specified in the note below.
--     5.Observe transmissions from the GEM.
--     6.Repeat steps (1) through (5) until all test patterns have been sent.
--
-- Note - Test patterns include:
--
--     a./-K28.5/+D16.2/-K28.5/+D16.2/-K28.5/+D16.2 ?
--     b./+K28.5/-D16.2/+K28.5/-D16.2 ?
--     c./+K28.5/-D5.6/-K28.5/+D5.6/+K28.5/-D5.6 ?
--     d./+K28.5/-D5.6/-K28.5/+D16.2/-K28.5/+D5.6/+K28.5/-D16.2 ?
--     e./-K28.5/+D16.2/-K28.5/+D10.2/+K28.5/-D16.2/+K28.5/-D10.2 ?
--     f./+K28.5/-D5.6/-K28.5/+D10.2/+K28.5/-D5.6/-K28.5/+D10.2 ?
--     g./-K28.5/+D10.2/+K28.5/-D10.2/+K28.5/-D10.2 ?
--     h./-K28.5/+D16.2/-K28.5/+D2.2/-D0.0/-D0.3/+K28.5/-D5.6/-K28.5/+D21.5/+D0.3/+D3.0 ?
--     i.2x(/-K28.5/+D16.2/) /-K28.5/+D2.2/-D0.0/-D0.3/+K28.5/-D5.6/-K28.5/+D16.2/ /-K28.5/+D21.5/+D0.0/+D0.3 ?
--     j.3x(/-K28.5/+D16.2/) /-K28.5/+D2.2/-D0.0/-D0.3/+K28.5/-D5.6 2x(/-K28.5/+D16.2/) /-K28.5/+D21.5/+D0.0/+D0.3 ?
--
-- Observable Results:
--
--     a.Test patterns (a) through (g) should allow the GEM to enter the LINK_OK state.
--     b.Test patterns (h) through (i) should prevent the GEM from entering the LINK_OK state.
--     c.Test pattern (j) should allow the GEM to enter the LINK_OK state.
--
-- Note: Entrance into LINK_OK can be observed by:
--
--        Observing if the GEM restarts auto-negotiation upon receipt of a /C/ code. This should occur in the LINK_OK state, but not in the IDLE_DETECT state.
--        Observing frame transmission from the GEM should indicate entrance into LINK_OK.
--
--
--
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

